   "wild_only": true,
   "in_the_wild": "Extinct; about 75-71 million years ago in Mongolia and northern China.",
   "caveats": "Real specimens stay in Mongolia; Western museums show casts. Small (turkey-sized), unlike film versions; Deinonychus and Utahraptor are the bigger relatives."
  },
